  "cmd_name": "set-group-deletion-protection",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "Sets deletion protection for a scaling group. If you enable deletion protection for a scaling group, you cannot delete the scaling group. If you disable deletion protection for a scaling group, you can directly delete the scaling group. You can call the SetGroupDeletionProtection operation to enable or disable deletion protection",
  "description_zh": "如果开启伸缩组删除保护功能后，此时不能删除该伸缩组；如果关闭伸缩组删除保护功能，此时可直接删除该伸缩组，本文为您介绍如何调用API SetGroupDeletionProtection为伸缩组开启或关闭伸缩组删除保护功能",
